// Subliminal: They Live-style messages flashed in time. Modes:
//   0 Flash: the word shows for Hold beats at the start of each bar
//   1 Strobe: on every beat for Hold of the beat
//   2 Steady: always on, changing each bar, with glitch
//   3 Reveal: hidden behind a bland "broadcast" until the DROP; flickers through in a BUILD
// Words come from the @messages list: First picks where to start, Count how many to use.
// Params are p_* uniforms; ranges and defaults are in subliminal.json.
//
// @messages: OBEY|CONSUME|SUBMIT|CONFORM|STAY ASLEEP|WATCH TV|NO THOUGHT|BUY|SLEEP|WAKE UP|THEY LIVE|TRUST NO ONE|THEY ARE WATCHING|QUESTION EVERYTHING|THE TRUTH IS OUT THERE|DO NOT RESIST
